                "date": "2025-01-24",
                "text": "If the card has {X} in its mana cost, the player must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost."
            },
            {
                "date": "2025-01-24",
                "text": "If Spell Queller leaves the battlefield before its \"enters\" ability resolves, its leaves-the-battlefield triggered ability triggers, resolves, and does nothing. Then its first triggered ability resolves and exiles the spell forever."
